        "node_id": "n_1_dbd3fc",
        "thought_text": "Use dynamic programming where dp[i][state] represents the minimum rest days up to day i, with state indicating the activity performed on day i (0=rest, 1=sport, 2=contest). Iterate through each day and transition based on availability and previous activity constraints.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "root",
