        "node_id": "n_13_4c5ba5",
        "thought_text": "Implement a standard Dynamic Programming approach where dp[i][j] stores the minimum rest days up to day i ending with activity j (0=rest, 1=sport, 2=contest), carefully initializing the base case for day 0 with infinity for non-rest states to prevent invalid transitions from a hypothetical 'previous day'.",
