        "thought_text": "Use a Breadth-First Search (BFS) or iterative state expansion starting from day 0, maintaining a set of reachable states (day_index, last_activity) with their associated minimum rest counts, pruning any path that violates the consecutive activity constraint or exceeds the current best known cost for a specific state.",
