        "thought_text": "Apply a greedy strategy with lookahead: for each day, prioritize activities that allow the next day to have more options, but recognize this might fail in edge cases where taking a suboptimal local step (e.g., resting today to enable two activities tomorrow) yields a better global result, making this approach risky without rigorous proof.",
